+
+## Discount codes
+
+- A code is 3 to 20 letters and digits. Codes are case-insensitive, and are
+  returned in upper case.
+- `percent` is from 1 to 50.
+- `expires_on` is an optional date, e.g. `"2026-12-31"`. The code works until
+  the end of that day, UK time. It can't already have passed.
+- A code that already exists is a `409`.
